		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Azure-blue, jovial humanoids made of air and roiling wind. Infused with potent magic.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 scimitar +7 (1d12) or 1 whirlwind, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Only damaged by magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Whirlwind</strong>. Transform into a lashing tornado. All enemies within near DC 18 DEX or thrown 2d100 feet in a random direction.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wish</strong>. Cast wish once a week for a mortal, no spellcasting check.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
